# The extended-Hueckel engine puts the Cu 4p band below Cu 4s here, so the band edge
# is a d -> p transition; the d -> s pair GM5+ #7 -> GM1+ #7 is forbidden (press "Show all energy
# levels" on the page, then click the two levels; GM1+ #7 lies outside the opening window), the origin of the dipole-forbidden yellow exciton series.
# The group theory alone, through the Python API (api.py):

$ python api.py

